// IntroString :
"P3928782737" "Someone really important was killed, Ambassador Maurer. Yeah, rough, I know. It gets worse. The potential suspects are... uncommon, dangerous oh and deadly.<br><br>You see, we can't narrow down the suspect list anymore than we already have without potentially causing an international incident. These are all BIG name people we're talking about.<br><br>So, I'm washing my hands of it. You heroes are always sweeping in and saving the day making us cops look bad, so the way I look at it, you owe us. How about you take care of this and I'll call it even?"
// AcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P2118261389" "Excellent. Well, I'll tell you what we know...<br><br><i>riffles through notes...</i><br><br>...Not much. We know who died, we just don't know how he died... where he died... oh and we don't know who exactly killed him. We've gotten the method, the location and the suspects down to ten... that's ten each.<br><br>So yeah, good luck with that."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1338917128" "<color deepskyblue>Investigate the Murder of <br>Ambassador Maurer</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P775628248" "Yeah, remember when I said we didn't know much about the crime... I was lying.<br><br>We really don't know anything about the crime. I blame the cut backs and the damn aliens - freakin' Rikti... Anyway, you're just going to have to go and investigate the  different locations, methods and suspects. When you're ready, you can come to me and make an accusation."
// TaskTitle :
"P4181567274" "<color deepskyblue>Investigate the Murder of Ambassador Maurer</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P856364347" ""

